      "source": "<code>formatter</code> - the formatter to add",
      "translation": "<code>formatter</code> - 要添加的格式化器",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>fieldType</code> - the field type to format",
      "translation": "<code>fieldType</code> - 要格式化的字段类型",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "On print, if the Formatter's type T is declared and <code>fieldType</code> is not assignable to T,\na coercion to T will be attempted before delegating to <code>formatter</code> to print a field value.\nOn parse, if the parsed object returned by <code>formatter</code> is not assignable to the runtime field type,\na coercion to the field type will be attempted before returning the parsed field value.",
      "translation": "在打印时，如果 Formatter 的类型 T 已声明且 `<code>fieldType</code>` 不可赋值给 T，则在委托给 `<code>formatter</code>` 打印字段值之前，将尝试将其强制转换为 T。在解析时，如果 `<code>formatter</code>` 返回的解析对象不可赋值于运行时字段类型，则在返回解析的字段值之前，将尝试将其强制转换为字段类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "On print, if the Printer's type T is declared and <code>fieldType</code> is not assignable to T,\na coercion to T will be attempted before delegating to <code>printer</code> to print a field value.\nOn parse, if the object returned by the Parser is not assignable to the runtime field type,\na coercion to the field type will be attempted before returning the parsed field value.",
      "translation": "在打印时，如果声明了 Printer 的类型 T 且 <code>fieldType</code> 不可赋值给 T，则在委托给 <code>printer</code> 打印字段值之前，将尝试将其强制转换为 T。在解析时，如果 Parser 返回的对象不可赋值于运行时字段类型，则在返回解析后的字段值之前，将尝试将其强制转换为字段类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
